OL,3,GNEWSAInvestigation remains open over
OL,4,Ateen festival death
OL,5,
OL,6,FAn investigation into a teenage girl's
OL,7,Fdeath at Kendal Calling festival
OL,8,Fremains open, police have said.
OL,10,FThe 17-year-old suffered a medical
OL,11,Fepisode at the festival site near
OL,12,FPenrith at about 02:15 BST on 2 August
OL,13,Fand was pronounced dead at the scene,
OL,14,Faccording to Cumbria Police.
OL,16,FThe force said her death was being
OL,17,Ftreated as non-suspicious but added her
OL,18,Ffile would be passed to the coroner to
OL,19,Finvestigate the circumstances
OL,20,Fsurrounding her death.
OL,23,APub: 14-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
